HST Office: Vietnamese labels that HST patches add or keep as patch context lose their trailing "..."/"…"
(owner rule 2026-11-06: no ellipsis unless the text is cut). Every other Vietnamese label is changed at
build time by scripts/l10n/apply-overrides.py (scripts/l10n/vi_ellipsis.py, exceptions in
data/l10n/vi-ellipsis-keep.json); these lines belong to earlier patches in the series, so they are changed here,
with the Vietnamese labels that patches write into files directly: the ≡ menu items "Báo lỗi cho HASON TECH" and
"Kiểm tra cập nhật HST Office" (popupmenu/notebookbar.xml) and the File ▸ Info button "Thiết lập USB Token".
Generated: series applied to a fresh tree, then the lines vi_ellipsis.py leaves to the patches.
Test: tests/unit/test_vi_no_ellipsis.py; apply-patches.sh --check.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).

